<title>USA: CareMatrix Q1 final results.</title>
<headline>CareMatrix Q1 final results.</headline>
<dateline>NEEDHAM, Mass. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>CareMatrix Corp said it reported net income of $814,600, or $0.05 per share, on revenues of $13,091,518 for the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The company did not report comparable first quarter results from 1996 because it only came into existence in October 1996.</p>
<p>CareMatrix provides senior housing services.</p>
